.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt MKDIR 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm mkdir
.Nd create directories
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl p
.Ar directory ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility creates each
.Ar directory
with mode 0755.
.Pp
With
.Fl p ,
every missing parent is created; an existing directory is not an error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rmdir 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
